            <span itemprop="Code">C08J2423/00</span>&mdash;<span itemprop="Description">Characterised by the use of homopolymers or copolymers of unsaturated aliphatic hydrocarbons having only one carbon-to-carbon double bond; Derivatives of such polymers</span>
            <meta itemprop="IsCPC" content="true">
