        <span itemprop="subject">Gurley number</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was less than 10 seconds, the sample did not shutdown, had a melt integrity more than 190° C., shrinkage of less than 5%, offset of less than 2% at 1000 psi which is an indication of high tensile strength (&gt;1000 Kg/cm2), puncture resistance of more than 450 grams.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="p-0047">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
